    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDevelopment opportunity to acquire private development with architectural plans to build 3 no. 2 bedroomed townhouses. The entire site provides an open space and private car parking while enjoying the private setting just off Thomas Hand Street. This is a rare opportunity to create a truly unique and exclusive development in a private setting that must be visited in order to fully appreciate the attractive central location.\n\nSkerries is a thriving seaside village famous for its sandy beaches and bustling town. Approx. 12 miles from Dublin airport and M1 motorway. \nThe area offers a plethora of activities to include outdoor walks in Ardgillan Demesne or Skerries beach promenade, sports clubs such as Cricket, Soccer, GAA, Tennis, Golf and Sailing to name a few.\n \nCopies of the permission, floor plans and site plan are available. This really is a unique opportunity to build in a sought after location with great privacy. If you have any further queries please contact our office. Planning Reference Number F09A/0464"
      },
      {
